Fireworks Festival of Feelings

00:22:48.680 --> 00:22:51.730
I have made note of the fact that this does not comprise a next episode preview.

00:22:51.730 --> 00:22:52.800
Yeah, but...

00:22:52.800 --> 00:22:54.890
Yeah, but...!

